# Marketing resources

`resources/` is **source art**, not the GitHub Pages tree. Do not link live
pages at these paths. Export selected shots into `images/` as 2x WebP + JPEG,
longest edge ~2560px, boring names (`BLUEPRINT.md` §8.5, §11.3).

Prefer **`resources/marketing-slates-simple/`** for v1 (cleaner, fewer themes).
The **complex** set is a larger library (per-slate windows, palettes, menu bar,
screen recordings) for later bands — not a dump onto the home page.

## Blueprint shot list → likely sources

| Blueprint shot | Simple (start here) | Complex (if needed) |
|----------------|---------------------|---------------------|
| Mac list, dark | `dark_fulldesktop_list_vertical.png` | `dark_fulldesktop_list_vertical_centered.png` |
| Mac focus view | `slate_main_dark.png`, `dark_fulldesktop_main.png` | `dark_window_slate*.png` |
| Light list variant | `light_fulldesktop_list_vertical.png` | same naming |
| Menu bar HUD | — | `dark_menubar.png` |

Crop tight. Full-desktop frames include Dock/menu bar; the money shot should
feel like the **window**, not a wallpaper ad. Sample text in these shots is
starter-catalog-like and is fine to show.

Do **not** autoplay the `.mov` files (`BLUEPRINT.md` §8.7, §14). Do not use
generic mockup sites or AI device frames instead of these photographs.
